{"id":"vol9-03","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-03/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":352.13,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.36,"text":"Part 4 You will hear part of a lecture given to students","words":[["Part",0.0,0.28],["4",0.28,0.7],["You",0.7,1.96],["will",1.96,2.18],["hear",2.18,2.42],["part",2.42,2.76],["of",2.76,2.92],["a",2.92,3.08],["lecture",3.08,3.36],["given",3.36,3.74],["to",3.74,3.94],["students",3.94,4.36]]},{"start":4.36,"end":10.58,"text":"in a food science department about safety standards. First, you have some time to look","words":[["in",4.36,4.64],["a",4.64,4.74],["food",4.74,5.04],["science",5.04,5.46],["department",5.46,6.08],["about",6.08,6.68],["safety",6.68,7.2],["standards.",7.2,7.84],["First,",8.68,9.36],["you",9.54,9.6],["have",9.6,9.74],["some",9.74,9.9],["time",9.9,10.24],["to",10.24,10.46],["look",10.46,10.58]]},{"start":10.58,"end":66.32,"text":"at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["at",10.58,10.7],["questions",10.7,11.0],["31",11.0,11.76],["to",11.76,11.96],["40.",11.96,12.32],["Now",62.72,63.08],["listen",63.08,63.38],["carefully",63.38,63.88],["and",63.88,64.22],["answer",64.22,64.6],["questions",64.6,64.92],["31",64.92,65.74],["to",65.74,65.94],["40.",65.94,66.32]]},{"start":68.18,"end":75.6,"text":"Good morning, everyone. In today's lecture, I'm going to talk about food safety and the","words":[["Good",68.18,68.86],["morning,",68.86,69.32],["everyone.",69.5,69.78],["In",70.7,71.26],["today's",71.26,71.78],["lecture,",71.78,72.12],["I'm",72.6,72.86],["going",72.86,73.02],["to",73.02,73.2],["talk",73.2,73.44],["about",73.44,73.74],["food",73.74,74.12],["safety",74.12,74.74],["and",74.74,75.44],["the",75.44,75.6]]},{"start":75.6,"end":80.86,"text":"factors involved in setting standards for the food industry with particular reference","words":[["factors",75.6,75.94],["involved",75.94,76.52],["in",76.52,76.92],["setting",76.92,77.24],["standards",77.24,77.86],["for",77.86,78.26],["the",78.26,78.38],["food",78.38,78.64],["industry",78.64,79.24],["with",79.24,79.68],["particular",79.68,80.28],["reference",80.28,80.86]]},{"start":80.86,"end":83.0,"text":"to the situation here in Australia.","words":[["to",80.86,81.24],["the",81.24,81.38],["situation",81.38,81.94],["here",81.94,82.36],["in",82.36,82.5],["Australia.",82.5,83.0]]},{"start":84.42,"end":88.52,"text":"Now, before anyone can decide what kind of standards","words":[["Now,",84.42,84.74],["before",85.44,85.76],["anyone",85.76,86.3],["can",86.3,86.62],["decide",86.62,87.08],["what",87.08,87.44],["kind",87.44,87.84],["of",87.84,88.06],["standards",88.06,88.52]]},{"start":88.52,"end":92.46,"text":"need to be set for ensuring that any specific food product","words":[["need",88.52,89.02],["to",89.02,89.18],["be",89.18,89.3],["set",89.3,89.66],["for",89.66,89.92],["ensuring",89.92,90.54],["that",90.54,91.02],["any",91.02,91.28],["specific",91.28,91.7],["food",91.7,92.08],["product",92.08,92.46]]},{"start":92.46,"end":96.2,"text":"is safe, scientists have to carry out a risk assessment.","words":[["is",92.46,92.76],["safe,",92.76,93.18],["scientists",93.7,94.08],["have",94.08,94.5],["to",94.5,94.64],["carry",94.64,94.92],["out",94.92,95.16],["a",95.16,95.36],["risk",95.36,95.62],["assessment.",95.62,96.2]]},{"start":97.24,"end":100.34,"text":"And in doing this, they have to consider","words":[["And",97.24,97.76],["in",97.76,98.32],["doing",98.32,98.54],["this,",98.54,98.96],["they",99.3,99.48],["have",99.48,99.74],["to",99.74,99.86],["consider",99.86,100.34]]},{"start":100.34,"end":102.26,"text":"several potential problems.","words":[["several",100.34,101.02],["potential",101.02,101.56],["problems.",101.56,102.26]]},{"start":103.1,"end":106.16,"text":"Firstly, they have to consider the ingredients","words":[["Firstly,",103.1,103.64],["they",104.36,104.6],["have",104.6,104.78],["to",104.78,104.9],["consider",104.9,105.38],["the",105.38,105.64],["ingredients",105.64,106.16]]},{"start":106.16,"end":107.26,"text":"of the product.","words":[["of",106.16,106.72],["the",106.72,106.82],["product.",106.82,107.26]]},{"start":107.26,"end":113.26,"text":"product. They have to decide whether any of these might make the finished product more","words":[["product.",107.26,107.8],["They",107.88,108.64],["have",108.64,108.86],["to",108.86,108.98],["decide",108.98,109.48],["whether",109.48,110.02],["any",110.02,110.38],["of",110.38,110.6],["these",110.6,110.88],["might",110.88,111.34],["make",111.34,111.68],["the",111.68,111.86],["finished",111.86,112.24],["product",112.24,112.84],["more",112.84,113.26]]},{"start":113.26,"end":120.86,"text":"susceptible to harmful bacteria. Then, they have to consider the process used in the preparation","words":[["susceptible",113.26,113.72],["to",113.72,114.56],["harmful",114.56,115.0],["bacteria.",115.0,115.64],["Then,",116.78,117.3],["they",117.66,117.84],["have",117.84,118.04],["to",118.04,118.16],["consider",118.16,118.56],["the",118.56,118.74],["process",118.74,119.16],["used",119.16,119.74],["in",119.74,120.22],["the",120.22,120.34],["preparation",120.34,120.86]]},{"start":120.86,"end":128.02,"text":"of the food, and whether or not it includes a step designed to eliminate unwanted microorganisms.","words":[["of",120.86,121.28],["the",121.28,121.42],["food,",121.42,121.78],["and",122.18,122.52],["whether",122.52,122.74],["or",122.74,122.96],["not",122.96,123.2],["it",123.2,123.48],["includes",123.48,123.88],["a",123.88,124.22],["step",124.22,124.46],["designed",124.46,125.04],["to",125.04,125.28],["eliminate",125.28,125.78],["unwanted",125.78,126.62],["microorganisms.",126.62,128.02]]},{"start":128.8,"end":134.9,"text":"After that, they've got to consider the way products are stored. For instance, in","words":[["After",128.8,129.54],["that,",129.54,129.82],["they've",130.2,130.52],["got",130.52,130.72],["to",130.72,130.94],["consider",130.94,131.38],["the",131.38,131.68],["way",131.68,131.88],["products",131.88,132.3],["are",132.3,132.6],["stored.",132.6,133.04],["For",133.66,133.88],["instance,",133.88,134.2],["in",134.52,134.9]]},{"start":134.9,"end":143.28,"text":"houses or cold stores and distributed to retailers. And it doesn't end there. The analysts even","words":[["houses",134.9,135.34],["or",135.34,135.66],["cold",135.66,136.04],["stores",136.04,136.56],["and",136.56,137.18],["distributed",137.18,137.78],["to",137.78,138.24],["retailers.",138.24,138.72],["And",139.66,140.0],["it",140.0,140.3],["doesn't",140.3,140.72],["end",140.72,140.96],["there.",140.96,141.32],["The",141.98,142.18],["analysts",142.18,142.8],["even",142.8,143.28]]},{"start":143.28,"end":148.56,"text":"have to be aware of problems that might occur after the food has reached the supermarket.","words":[["have",143.28,143.58],["to",143.58,143.72],["be",143.72,143.86],["aware",143.86,144.36],["of",144.36,144.7],["problems",144.7,145.1],["that",145.1,145.38],["might",145.38,145.68],["occur",145.68,146.14],["after",146.14,146.68],["the",146.68,146.88],["food",146.88,147.24],["has",147.24,147.5],["reached",147.5,147.88],["the",147.88,148.12],["supermarket.",148.12,148.56]]},{"start":149.52,"end":156.4,"text":"Things like frozen foods being defrosted and then refrozen because the temperature fluctuated","words":[["Things",149.52,149.94],["like",149.94,150.24],["frozen",150.24,150.74],["foods",150.74,151.2],["being",151.2,151.58],["defrosted",151.58,152.4],["and",152.4,152.6],["then",152.6,152.76],["refrozen",152.76,153.58],["because",153.58,154.52],["the",154.52,154.76],["temperature",154.76,155.38],["fluctuated",155.38,156.4]]},{"start":156.74,"end":163.46,"text":"or foods being kept past their expiry date. And finally, any assessment of the overall","words":[["or",156.74,157.16],["foods",157.16,157.48],["being",157.48,157.76],["kept",157.76,158.06],["past",158.06,158.54],["their",158.54,158.76],["expiry",158.76,159.28],["date.",159.28,159.7],["And",160.24,160.48],["finally,",160.48,160.98],["any",161.54,161.86],["assessment",161.86,162.44],["of",162.44,162.84],["the",162.84,162.98],["overall",162.98,163.46]]},{"start":163.46,"end":169.92,"text":"risk has to take into account the way the end users, consumers, normally handle food at","words":[["risk",163.46,163.9],["has",163.9,164.34],["to",164.34,164.54],["take",164.54,164.76],["into",164.76,165.06],["account",165.06,165.52],["the",165.52,165.9],["way",165.9,166.12],["the",166.12,166.28],["end",166.28,166.56],["users,",166.56,166.96],["consumers,",167.38,167.86],["normally",168.36,168.78],["handle",168.78,169.26],["food",169.26,169.64],["at",169.64,169.92]]},{"start":169.92,"end":175.16,"text":"home. So, as you see, the risk assessment is quite complicated.","words":[["home.",169.92,170.28],["So,",170.9,171.32],["as",171.78,172.0],["you",172.0,172.14],["see,",172.14,172.38],["the",172.8,172.9],["risk",172.9,173.14],["assessment",173.14,173.6],["is",173.6,174.1],["quite",174.1,174.48],["complicated.",174.48,175.16]]},{"start":181.16,"end":186.84,"text":"Now, there are several factors affecting what kind of food we eat, only one of which is","words":[["Now,",181.16,181.42],["there",181.76,182.18],["are",182.18,182.3],["several",182.3,182.66],["factors",182.66,183.16],["affecting",183.16,183.76],["what",183.76,184.06],["kind",184.06,184.3],["of",184.3,184.44],["food",184.44,184.7],["we",184.7,184.92],["eat,",184.92,185.28],["only",185.7,185.98],["one",185.98,186.22],["of",186.22,186.36],["which",186.36,186.58],["is",186.58,186.84]]},{"start":186.84,"end":194.2,"text":"legislation. Another is the attitudes of consumers. A good example of this is the","words":[["legislation.",186.84,187.4],["Another",188.48,188.84],["is",188.84,189.44],["the",189.44,189.56],["attitudes",189.56,190.14],["of",190.14,190.76],["consumers.",190.76,191.34],["A",192.36,192.62],["good",192.62,192.78],["example",192.78,193.24],["of",193.24,193.5],["this",193.5,193.74],["is",193.74,194.04],["the",194.04,194.2]]},{"start":194.2,"end":200.18,"text":"dislike that many Australians have for additives in their food, even when these additives are","words":[["dislike",194.2,194.62],["that",194.62,194.98],["many",194.98,195.26],["Australians",195.26,195.68],["have",195.68,196.24],["for",196.24,196.46],["additives",196.46,196.94],["in",196.94,197.22],["their",197.22,197.36],["food,",197.36,197.74],["even",198.22,198.62],["when",198.62,198.86],["these",198.86,199.14],["additives",199.14,199.74],["are",199.74,200.18]]},{"start":200.18,"end":206.06,"text":"considered safe and without them products have a shorter shelf life or a substandard appearance.","words":[["considered",200.18,200.62],["safe",200.62,201.08],["and",201.08,201.82],["without",201.82,202.06],["them",202.06,202.26],["products",202.26,202.6],["have",202.6,202.92],["a",202.92,203.1],["shorter",203.1,203.34],["shelf",203.34,203.72],["life",203.72,204.04],["or",204.04,204.6],["a",204.6,204.8],["substandard",204.8,205.52],["appearance.",205.52,206.06]]},{"start":206.98,"end":212.3,"text":"This has led to the phenomenal expansion of the market for organic food in Australia.","words":[["This",206.98,207.4],["has",207.4,207.54],["led",207.54,207.76],["to",207.76,207.98],["the",207.98,208.12],["phenomenal",208.12,208.68],["expansion",208.68,209.46],["of",209.46,209.88],["the",209.88,210.0],["market",210.0,210.34],["for",210.34,210.68],["organic",210.68,211.06],["food",211.06,211.6],["in",211.6,211.92],["Australia.",211.92,212.3]]},{"start":213.52,"end":220.02,"text":"Another important influence on what we eat is the food industry itself. In some large","words":[["Another",213.52,214.18],["important",214.18,214.92],["influence",214.92,215.48],["on",215.48,215.92],["what",215.92,216.08],["we",216.08,216.28],["eat",216.28,216.58],["is",216.58,216.78],["the",216.78,216.94],["food",216.94,217.18],["industry",217.18,217.78],["itself.",217.78,218.26],["In",219.04,219.38],["some",219.38,219.64],["large",219.64,220.02]]},{"start":220.02,"end":226.7,"text":"supermarkets low prices are the main strategy for attracting customers, while for more upscale","words":[["supermarkets",220.02,220.74],["low",220.74,221.36],["prices",221.36,221.98],["are",221.98,222.34],["the",222.34,222.46],["main",222.46,222.7],["strategy",222.7,223.3],["for",223.3,223.64],["attracting",223.64,224.14],["customers,",224.14,224.8],["while",225.12,225.74],["for",225.74,225.94],["more",225.94,226.12],["upscale",226.12,226.7]]},{"start":226.7,"end":233.5,"text":"marketers image is more important. But we should bear in mind for all of them the key consideration","words":[["marketers",226.7,227.26],["image",227.26,227.8],["is",227.8,228.34],["more",228.34,228.54],["important.",228.54,229.06],["But",229.94,230.22],["we",230.22,230.38],["should",230.38,230.56],["bear",230.56,230.76],["in",230.76,230.9],["mind",230.9,231.2],["for",231.2,231.52],["all",231.52,231.88],["of",231.88,232.02],["them",232.02,232.28],["the",232.28,232.58],["key",232.58,232.78],["consideration",232.78,233.5]]},{"start":233.5,"end":242.16,"text":"is profitability. Finally there's the influence of the mass media which is the most important","words":[["is",233.5,234.2],["profitability.",234.2,234.86],["Finally",236.56,237.4],["there's",237.4,238.22],["the",238.22,238.34],["influence",238.34,238.76],["of",238.76,239.18],["the",239.18,239.3],["mass",239.3,239.7],["media",239.7,240.12],["which",240.12,240.68],["is",240.68,240.88],["the",240.88,241.06],["most",241.06,241.42],["important",241.42,242.16]]},{"start":242.16,"end":249.56,"text":"source of information for most people. Unfortunately this has a rather negative effect because","words":[["source",242.16,242.54],["of",242.54,242.78],["information",242.78,243.24],["for",243.24,243.82],["most",243.82,244.1],["people.",244.1,244.52],["Unfortunately",245.24,246.06],["this",246.06,246.82],["has",246.82,247.0],["a",247.0,247.16],["rather",247.16,247.48],["negative",247.48,248.08],["effect",248.08,248.72],["because",248.72,249.56]]},{"start":249.56,"end":252.24,"text":"Because in general, they are not very objective.","words":[["Because",249.56,249.66],["in",249.66,249.88],["general,",249.88,250.34],["they",250.78,250.86],["are",250.86,250.98],["not",250.98,251.26],["very",251.26,251.58],["objective.",251.58,252.24]]},{"start":253.1,"end":258.36,"text":"For one thing, the prime motivation of the media, as with the food industry, is sales.","words":[["For",253.1,253.36],["one",253.36,253.68],["thing,",253.68,253.96],["the",254.28,254.34],["prime",254.34,254.64],["motivation",254.64,255.12],["of",255.12,255.54],["the",255.54,255.66],["media,",255.66,256.08],["as",256.26,256.54],["with",256.54,256.7],["the",256.7,256.82],["food",256.82,257.04],["industry,",257.04,257.54],["is",257.82,257.94],["sales.",257.94,258.36]]},{"start":258.92,"end":263.3,"text":"And this has a major influence on the way in which the topic is dealt with.","words":[["And",258.92,259.12],["this",259.12,259.34],["has",259.34,259.56],["a",259.56,259.84],["major",259.84,260.3],["influence",260.3,260.92],["on",260.92,261.3],["the",261.3,261.42],["way",261.42,261.66],["in",261.66,261.8],["which",261.8,261.98],["the",261.98,262.2],["topic",262.2,262.54],["is",262.54,262.82],["dealt",262.82,263.04],["with.",263.04,263.3]]},{"start":264.08,"end":268.48,"text":"A further problem is that news is regarded as a type of entertainment.","words":[["A",264.08,264.26],["further",264.26,264.58],["problem",264.58,265.08],["is",265.08,265.56],["that",265.56,265.74],["news",265.74,266.08],["is",266.08,266.42],["regarded",266.42,266.84],["as",266.84,267.24],["a",267.24,267.38],["type",267.38,267.62],["of",267.62,267.76],["entertainment.",267.76,268.48]]},{"start":269.3,"end":274.8,"text":"Often, the issues that get a top billing are those that are sensational or controversial.","words":[["Often,",269.3,269.82],["the",270.16,270.32],["issues",270.32,270.7],["that",270.7,270.9],["get",270.9,271.04],["a",271.04,271.18],["top",271.18,271.48],["billing",271.48,271.84],["are",271.84,272.32],["those",272.32,272.54],["that",272.54,272.78],["are",272.78,272.92],["sensational",272.92,273.64],["or",273.64,274.14],["controversial.",274.14,274.8]]},{"start":274.8,"end":280.7,"text":"So it's not at all surprising if the public ends up with a rather distorted understanding","words":[["So",274.8,275.3],["it's",275.3,276.16],["not",276.16,276.34],["at",276.34,276.48],["all",276.48,276.7],["surprising",276.7,277.36],["if",277.36,278.02],["the",278.02,278.14],["public",278.14,278.4],["ends",278.4,278.74],["up",278.74,278.94],["with",278.94,279.08],["a",279.08,279.2],["rather",279.2,279.44],["distorted",279.44,280.1],["understanding",280.1,280.7]]},{"start":280.7,"end":282.72,"text":"of food and food safety.","words":[["of",280.7,281.08],["food",281.08,281.4],["and",281.4,281.98],["food",281.98,282.22],["safety.",282.22,282.72]]},{"start":284.34,"end":290.02,"text":"On top of that, up till now, food safety and nutrition have never been considered a really","words":[["On",284.34,284.68],["top",284.68,284.9],["of",284.9,285.1],["that,",285.1,285.32],["up",285.7,285.88],["till",285.88,286.08],["now,",286.08,286.36],["food",286.56,286.74],["safety",286.74,287.16],["and",287.16,287.46],["nutrition",287.46,287.88],["have",287.88,288.32],["never",288.32,288.66],["been",288.66,288.92],["considered",288.92,289.42],["a",289.42,289.7],["really",289.7,290.02]]},{"start":290.02,"end":291.9,"text":"interesting topic for the public.","words":[["interesting",290.02,290.68],["topic",290.68,291.22],["for",291.22,291.44],["the",291.44,291.54],["public.",291.54,291.9]]},{"start":292.58,"end":299.24,"text":"Very few TV or radio shows address the issues, and even those shows that are devoted to","words":[["Very",292.58,293.04],["few",293.04,293.38],["TV",293.38,293.88],["or",293.88,294.3],["radio",294.3,294.66],["shows",294.66,295.18],["address",295.18,295.64],["the",295.64,295.96],["issues,",295.96,296.4],["and",296.82,297.18],["even",297.18,297.42],["those",297.42,297.7],["shows",297.7,298.08],["that",298.08,298.36],["are",298.36,298.5],["devoted",298.5,298.96],["to",298.96,299.24]]},{"start":299.24,"end":301.58,"text":"cooking or eating generally ignore them.","words":[["cooking",299.24,299.52],["or",299.52,299.86],["eating",299.86,300.18],["generally",300.18,300.82],["ignore",300.82,301.32],["them.",301.32,301.58]]},{"start":302.5,"end":307.92,"text":"At this point, I'll just offer a personal opinion on this subject of food safety.","words":[["At",302.5,303.18],["this",303.18,303.42],["point,",303.42,303.74],["I'll",304.1,304.5],["just",304.5,304.66],["offer",304.66,305.02],["a",305.02,305.28],["personal",305.28,305.7],["opinion",305.7,306.18],["on",306.18,306.48],["this",306.48,306.64],["subject",306.64,307.04],["of",307.04,307.28],["food",307.28,307.5],["safety.",307.5,307.92]]},{"start":308.64,"end":315.32,"text":"I firmly believe in food safety education, starting at primary schools.","words":[["I",308.64,309.06],["firmly",309.06,309.64],["believe",309.64,310.4],["in",310.4,310.76],["food",310.76,311.1],["safety",311.1,311.56],["education,",311.56,312.46],["starting",312.66,313.5],["at",313.5,314.04],["primary",314.04,314.72],["schools.",314.72,315.32]]},{"start":316.24,"end":320.64,"text":"We know that many children who have been taught about the benefits of exercise","words":[["We",316.24,316.56],["know",316.56,316.8],["that",316.8,316.96],["many",316.96,317.24],["children",317.24,317.78],["who",317.78,318.4],["have",318.4,318.56],["been",318.56,318.74],["taught",318.74,319.06],["about",319.06,319.38],["the",319.38,319.54],["benefits",319.54,319.92],["of",319.92,320.14],["exercise",320.14,320.64]]},{"start":320.64,"end":323.56,"text":"come home and lecture their parents about it.","words":[["come",320.64,321.38],["home",321.38,321.76],["and",321.76,322.02],["lecture",322.02,322.36],["their",322.36,322.58],["parents",322.58,322.98],["about",322.98,323.28],["it.",323.28,323.56]]},{"start":324.2,"end":327.72,"text":"So, the same could be done for food and food preparation.","words":[["So,",324.2,324.54],["the",324.98,325.22],["same",325.22,325.5],["could",325.5,325.7],["be",325.7,325.86],["done",325.86,326.1],["for",326.1,326.28],["food",326.28,326.64],["and",326.64,326.86],["food",326.86,327.1],["preparation.",327.1,327.72]]},{"start":327.72,"end":332.5,"text":"And at the same time, the countless educational television shows.","words":[["And",327.72,328.72],["at",328.72,328.86],["the",328.86,328.96],["same",328.96,329.24],["time,",329.24,329.64],["the",330.06,330.16],["countless",330.16,330.62],["educational",330.62,331.5],["television",331.5,332.02],["shows.",332.02,332.5]]},{"start":335.71,"end":341.79,"text":"That is the end of part four. You now have one minute to check your answers to part four.","words":[["That",335.71,336.29],["is",336.29,336.43],["the",336.43,336.57],["end",336.57,336.91],["of",336.91,337.07],["part",337.07,337.25],["four.",337.25,337.67],["You",338.33,338.59],["now",338.59,338.85],["have",338.85,339.17],["one",339.17,339.45],["minute",339.45,339.79],["to",339.79,340.05],["check",340.05,340.37],["your",340.37,340.55],["answers",340.55,340.93],["to",340.93,341.17],["part",341.17,341.39],["four.",341.39,341.79]]}]}